[21.631103, "o", "lets Claude handle permission prompts automatically. Claude checks each tool call for risky\u001b[39m       \u001b[38;5;174m\u001b[8;1H▎\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mactions and prompt injection before executing, runs the ones it assesses as lower-risk, and blocks the rest.\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;174m\u001b[9;1H▎\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m\u001b]8;id=tmux2;https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permission-modes\u001b\\https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permission-modes\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\u001b[1m\r\n✓ Enhanced $0.03\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1m[ Enhance (e) ]\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[1m[ Send (s) ]\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1m[ Undo (u) ]\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[38;5;246mfable 5.1 · 1 of 3 · 5.5s · 0 cached · 1.9k i…\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m[-]\u001b[39m \u001b[23;1H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
